# Observed precipitation accumulation (inches) — MRMS QPE ramp.
# Same family as precip.clr (the models-tab QPF ramp) so forecast and
# observed precip read as one visual language in the app, extended past
# 5" because 12/24-hour observed totals in flood events routinely exceed
# the QPF ramp's ceiling (10-20" in Gulf/flash-flood setups).
# Binned (no interpolate_color): decode renders with -nearest_color_entry.
nv     0   0   0   0
0.00   0   0   0   0
0.01   180 220 200 80
0.05   140 200 180 140
0.10   100 180 160 200
0.25   80  160 220 240
0.50   60  120 230 255
0.75   80  100 200 255
1.00   120 80  180 255
1.50   160 60  160 255
2.00   200 60  140 255
2.50   220 80  100 255
3.00   220 100 60  255
4.00   220 140 60  255
5.00   220 180 80  255
6.00   230 210 110 255
8.00   245 235 170 255
10.00  255 255 255 255
15.00  255 170 220 255
20.00  255 90  200 255
